  _modifiedTicks: 639272563511155314
  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F42D\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Saved from a wildcat
  _description: The [[5fa1b2c9-d6af-4624-a28a-bb96064706e6|Tin Woodman]] saves her
    from a wildcat. In return her mice pull the sleeping [[cebed64d-0745-4442-a719-09ba8e20401e|Cowardly
    Lion]] out of the [[ba69a581-8516-409c-b993-4802f3562380|Deadly Poppy Field]]
    on a little wooden truck.
